extlimit=\"\" class=\"title large ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Simplify your business travel management.</span><!----></h2><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Already a Saudia member? <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/business/login-landing\" target=\"_blank\">Login</a></span><!----></p><!----><button mat-button=\"\" role=\"link\" class=\"mat-focus-indicator button--primary mat-button mat-button-base ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"mat-button-wrapper\"><span appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"ctaText\"> Join Saudia Business </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\"> call_made </span></span><span matripple=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-button-ripple\"></span><span class=\"mat-button-focus-overlay\"></span></button><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description medium ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Saudia Business gives your company one account to book flights, manage travelers, and track travel spending. Eligible companies also earn Business Miles and access corporate fares.</span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"title ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Why companies choose Saudia Business</span><!----></h2><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">A self-service portal for managing your company's travel in one place.</span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-list-component\"><ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Earn Business Miles on every trip</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Your company earns Business Miles on eligible bookings made through the account. Travelers continue to earn AlFursan Miles on eligible flights, so individuals and the company are rewarded separately.</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Better travel for your employees</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Employees travel with access to eligible services such as flexible bookings, seat selection, and upgrades, based on your company's contract.</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Built-in travel policy</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Apply your company's travel rules directly in the booking flow, so bookings stay within travel policy without extra steps.</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Clear approval workflow</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Approvers can review and approve bookings in one workflow, keeping travel within policy.</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Reporting and insights</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Track spending, trends, and travel activity in real-time dashboards to support budgeting and reporting.</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Dedicated support</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">A dedicated team is available to help with bookings, changes, and account questions.</span><!----></div></li><!----></ul><!----><!----></div></app-jss-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><section class=\"cms-img-component without-img\"><div class=\"cms-img-wrapper\"><div class=\"cms-img-container\"><!----><!----></div></div><div class=\"cms-img-component-content container h--center ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-img-content-wrapper\"><!----><h2 appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Start managing your company's travel</span><!----></h2><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">No setup fees. Get started in a few steps.</span><!----></p><!----><div><app-jss-count-down-timer><!----></app-jss-count-down-timer></div><button class=\"button button--primary ng-star-inserted\"><span>Join Saudia Business</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\"> call_made </span></button><!----></div><div class=\"cms-img-container\"><!----><!----></div></div><!----></section></app-jss-image><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"title large ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Related FAQs</span><!----></h2><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description medium ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/business/help/faqs\">View all FAQs</a></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-accordion class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-accordion-compnent ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion cms__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-1 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-2 ng-tns-c1859850774-1 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-2\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-2\"><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Who can join Saudia Business?</div><!----></mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-1\"><div class=\"mat-panel-body-custom font-color ng-star-inserted\">Eligible companies and organizations can apply for Saudia Business. Registration is subject to company verification, eligibility requirements, acceptance of the applicable terms and Saudia approval.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-3 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-4 ng-tns-c1859850774-3 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-4\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-4\"><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\">How does my company register?</div><!----></mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-3\"><div class=\"mat-panel-body-custom font-color ng-star-inserted\">Select “Register Now,” complete the company and Account Administrator information, provide the required company and verification details, and submit the application. Submission does not guarantee approval. If Saudia approves the application, the Account Administrator will receive instructions to complete the initial account setup.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-5 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-6 ng-tns-c1859850774-5 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-6\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-6\"><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\">What documents are required?</div><!----></mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-5\"><div class=\"mat-panel-body-custom font-color ng-star-inserted\">Required documents may include the company Commercial Registration, VAT certificate, National Address, and authorized contact information. Additional documents may be requested during verification.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-7 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-8 ng-tns-c1859850774-7 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-8\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-8\"><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Can administrators and travel arrangers book for employees?</div><!----></mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-7\"><div class=\"mat-panel-body-custom font-color ng-star-inserted\">Yes. Company administrators can manage users and assign travel arrangers. Authorized travel arrangers can book for eligible employees or travelers according to assigned permissions and the company travel policy.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-9 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-10 ng-tns-c1859850774-9 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-10\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-10\"><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\">How does the company earn Business Miles?</div><!----></mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-10 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-9\"><div class=\"mat-panel-body-custom font-color ng-star-inserted\">The company can earn Business Miles on eligible bookings made under its Saudia Business account. Travelers may also earn individual AlFursan Miles on eligible flights when their membership details are added.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-11 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-12 ng-tns-c1859850774-11 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-5\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-12\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-12\"><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Can bookings be changed or refunded online?</div><!----></mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-12 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-11 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-5\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-5\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-11\"><div class=\"mat-panel-body-custom font-color ng-star-inserted\">Eligible bookings can be changed, cancelled, or refunded through the platform, subject to fare rules, applicable charges, payment method, service availability, and booking status.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-accordion><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}